version: 1
format: 1 2 0 0 0 3 (BMP is 1, PNG 2, JPEG 3, unknown 0)
rgb24: 2 by 2: FFFF0000 FF00FF00 FF0000FF FFFFFFFF
rgba32: 2 by 1: 80FF0000 00123456
png palette: 2 by 2: FFFF0000 8000FF00 FF0000FF FF000000
png gray16: 3 by 1: 00121212 FF808080 FFFFFFFF
png signature only: refused: the file is cut short
png cut short: 2 by 2: FFFF0000 8000FF00 FF0000FF FF000000
png no data: refused: no data was given
png as bmp: refused: not a BMP file
bmp as png: refused: not a PNG file
jpeg: 2 by 2: FFF4C287 FF004300 FF3854DB FFC074FF
jpeg without its end: 2 by 2: FFF4C287 FF004300 FF3854DB FFC074FF
jpeg as png: refused: not a PNG file
png as jpeg: refused: not a JPEG file
jpeg no data: refused: no data was given
empty: refused: not an image format imagelib reads
no data: refused: no data was given
cut short: 2 by 2: 00000000 00000000 FF0000FF FFFFFFFF
last row unpadded: 2 by 2: FFFF0000 FF00FF00 FF0000FF FFFFFFFF
limit 4: 2 by 2: FFFF0000 FF00FF00 FF0000FF FFFFFFFF
png limit 4: 2 by 2: FFFF0000 8000FF00 FF0000FF FF000000
limit 3: refused: 2 by 2 is more than the limit of 3 pixels
png limit 3: refused: 2 by 2 is more than the limit of 3 pixels
jpeg limit 3: refused: 2 by 2 is more than the limit of 3 pixels
default limit: 16777216
blended: 00800000 FF102030 00010203 00606060 00010101 12CCBBAA
none blended: 00800000